Subject: [PATCH 4/6] sms: paste images into the compose field

Paste in the message field, from Ctrl+V or from the right-click menu, now
attaches an image from the clipboard: a bitmap such as a screenshot or
"Copy Image" is written to a PNG on a worker thread, under the per-user
runtime directory, and attached when it is ready; image files copied in a
file manager are attached directly. When the clipboard holds text,
including text that comes with a rendered image, it pastes as text.
Both paths go through the field's paste(), which the desktop style's
context menu calls, and canPaste now also counts an image. If the image
cannot be read or saved, an error message above the field says why; a paste
never silently does nothing.

Attachments picked in the file dialog are now added to the ones already
selected instead of replacing them.
